Gaze straight ahead

299
00:26:00,340 --> 00:26:03,140
おねだりしてみて 欲しいの? ダーリン
Do you want me to pester you, darling?

300
00:26:03,140 --> 00:26:07,840
私はあなたの気持ちを全然知らないわ
I don't know your feelings at all

301
00:26:07,840 --> 00:26:11,840
あれほど健気に見つめてきたのに 今ではすっかり知らんぷり
I've gazed at you so gallantly, yet now you pretend not to know

302
00:26:11,840 --> 00:26:14,840
ていうか それって胡坐かいてるだけなんじゃないですか
I mean, isn't that just resting on your laurels?

303
00:26:14,840 --> 00:26:17,540
お願いダーリン 見て聞いて 欲しいのは 形のないもの
Please, darling, look at me, listen. What I want is a shapeless thing

304
00:26:17,540 --> 00:26:23,540
馬鹿にしないわ 見て聞いて 覗いてよ 瞳の奥の方
I won't make fun of you. Look at me, listen. Peek deep in my eyes

305
00:26:23,540 --> 00:26:30,540
お願いダーリン 寝てないで 甘えてよ 私の素顔
Please, darling, don't keep sleeping. Expose my honest face

306
00:26:30,540 --> 00:26:36,540
お願いダーリン そばにいて 触らせて 心の奥の方
Please, darling, stay by my side. Let me touch deep in your heart

307
00:26:36,540 --> 00:26:42,540
真っ直ぐ 見つめて おねだりしてみて 見てみてほしいの
Gaze straight ahead, won't you pester me and look at me?

308
00:26:58,240 --> 00:27:00,040
お願いダーリン
Please, darling

309
00:27:04,894 --> 00:27:07,494
イエーイ！ ほらライブ一期の 天才ヴァンパイアよ！
Yay! Look, it's Hololive 1st Gen's genius vampire!

310
00:27:07,494 --> 00:27:11,094
ほらライブ一期の 空中メルです！
Look, it's Hololive 1st Gen's Yozora Mel!

311
00:27:11,094 --> 00:27:17,294
えーと… ほらライブ会の 天才ヴァンパイアやー！ えーと、極生のねねで…
Um... Hololive's genius vampire! Um, Nene from Gokusei...

312
00:27:17,294 --> 00:27:22,094
ふたり合わせて せーの！ ねねめるねるねって！
Together, ready, go! Nene Meru Nerune!

313
00:27:22,094 --> 00:27:27,194
ー！ 完璧じゃーん！ いいじゃーん！ よかった！
Perfect! That's great! Wonderful!

314
00:27:27,194 --> 00:27:33,094
この前のホロライブで鍛えられたのね すごい鍛えられたよね よかったね
You got so much stronger from the last Hololive event, didn't you?

315
00:27:36,694 --> 00:27:39,154
でさ、メルメル先輩5周年？
So, Mel-senpai, 5th anniversary?

316
00:27:39,154 --> 00:27:41,494
そうだよ！5周年だったよ！イエーイ！
That's right, 5th anniversary! Yay!

317
00:27:41,494 --> 00:27:46,174
ねぇねぇ今回の衣装めっちゃ可愛い！
Hey, hey, this outfit is super cute!

318
00:27:46,174 --> 00:27:49,014
そうなんだよちょっとウェディングっぽい感じの
Yeah, it has a bit of a wedding-like feel.

319
00:27:49,014 --> 00:27:53,374
ホイップっぽい なんかお菓子みたいなイメージだね
Like whipped cream, kinda like sweets image.

320
00:27:53,374 --> 00:27:57,694
そうだね ケーキも後ろにあるしね
That's right, there's a cake in the back too.

321
00:27:57,694 --> 00:28:00,714
ねぇ おしりすごいね おしり！
Hey, the back is amazing, the back!

322
00:28:00,714 --> 00:28:04,534
え? ちょっとね、これからもね、ちょっと先輩なのだけど
Eh? Well, even though I'm your senior...

323
00:28:04,534 --> 00:28:06,174
これ何ですか これ?
What is this? What's this?

324
00:28:06,174 --> 00:28:10,634
ええと ここも吸ってる これ え 吸ってないし
Ugh, wait, are you sucking here too? Eh, I'm not sucking!

325
00:28:10,634 --> 00:28:13,294
でもね、これからもね… よろしくお願いします！
But hey, from now on... Yoroshiku onegaishimasu!

326
00:28:13,294 --> 00:28:16,934
はーい、よろしくね！ はーいとして、よろしくね！
Ha-ii, yoroshiku ne! Ha-ii to shite, yoroshiku ne!

327
00:28:16,934 --> 00:28:20,234
あ、ありがとう！ よろしくね！
Ah, thank you! Yoroshiku ne!

328
00:28:20,234 --> 00:28:25,474
じゃあね、メルメル先輩はまだね、これからもいっぱいあると思うので
Well, Mel-senpai still has a lot more ahead, I think.

329
00:28:25,474 --> 00:28:29,914
ありますとも！ まだまだ帰りましょうか、ね？
There is! Shall we head home soon, huh?

330
00:28:29,914 --> 00:28:32,534
え？ じゃあ、頑張って！ 頑張ってね！
Eh? Well then, do your best! Do your best!

331
00:28:32,534 --> 00:28:36,654
ありがとう！ なになになになに？ なに？
Thank you! What, what, what, what? What?

332
00:28:36,654 --> 00:28:39,154
まだ返さないよ！ きゃ！
I won't let you go yet! Kya!

333
00:28:52,833 --> 00:28:55,373
喜びも 悲しみも
Joy too, sadness too

334
00:28:55,373 --> 00:28:58,243
あなたさえ 五等分なんです
Even you are divided into five equal parts

335
00:28:58,243 --> 00:29:00,793
1つ つくり笑いも見抜かれ
1: Your forced smile is seen through

336
00:29:00,793 --> 00:29:04,873
2つ あなたなんか大嫌いよ
2: I really hate you!

337
00:29:04,873 --> 00:29:07,493
3つ 真っ直ぐなこの気持ち気づいて
3: Notice these straightforward feelings

338
00:29:07,493 --> 00:29:09,953
4つ 気づくとだんだん
4: Before I knew it, gradually

339
00:29:09,953 --> 00:29:12,793
5つ 分かり合えたね
5: We came to understand each other, didn't we?

340
00:29:12,793 --> 00:29:15,933
勉強だけじゃなくて 君を知りたいの
Instead of just studying, I want to know more about you

341
00:29:15,933 --> 00:29:18,473
大嫌いから 大好きへと
From "I hate you" to "I love you"

342
00:29:18,473 --> 00:29:21,293
変わる心についていけないよ
I can't keep up with this changing heart

343
00:29:21,293 --> 00:29:23,873
どんなことも あなたさえ
No matter what, even you

344
00:29:23,873 --> 00:29:26,613
五等分です
Are divided into five equal parts

345
00:29:56,590 --> 00:30:00,040
でも私私私私私は あなたが好きだよ
But I, I, I, I, I love you!

346
00:30:00,406 --> 00:30:01,366
私、私は
I, I...

347
00:30:01,946 --> 00:30:04,006
あなたが好きよ
...love you!

348
00:30:13,904 --> 00:30:16,484
少し複雑に 心の中
My heart is a little complicated,

349
00:30:16,684 --> 00:30:19,244
でもかわっていく 気持ち
but these feelings are changing.

350
00:30:19,684 --> 00:30:24,284
ずっとこんな関係 続いたらいいのにな
I hope a relationship like this lasts forever.

351
00:30:24,684 --> 00:30:27,524
忘れられない思い出も
Unforgettable memories,

352
00:30:27,864 --> 00:30:29,984
これから増えるストーリーも
and the stories that will grow from now on—

353
00:30:30,344 --> 00:30:36,564
あなたなしだったら 意味がない！認めよ
without you, they have no meaning! Admit it!

354
00:30:37,744 --> 00:30:43,424
ぶつかっては 教えてね
When we clash, teach me,

355
00:30:44,264 --> 00:30:50,584
だけど勝手に胸の鼓動 高まる運命だって
yet my heart beats faster on its own—I believe it's fate.

356
00:30:51,964 --> 00:30:54,484
信じられる
I believe it.

357
00:30:55,184 --> 00:30:56,824
同じ気持ちで
With the same feelings,

358
00:30:57,224 --> 00:31:00,724
またいつか いつか いつか 叶う夢に見るから
I'll dream of it coming true someday, someday, someday.

359
00:31:13,184 --> 00:31:15,584
少しずつ変わる 思い
Feelings that change little by little,

360
00:31:15,944 --> 00:31:18,964
アセりやイライラじゃ笑えない
we can't smile with impatience and irritation.

361
00:31:19,224 --> 00:31:22,464
信じきれる 自信
The confidence to fully believe,

362
00:31:22,464 --> 00:31:25,804
胸の奥に隠れてる 言葉
words hidden deep within my chest.

363
00:31:26,044 --> 00:31:29,664
伝えべただけどいいんですか？
Is it okay even if I'm clumsy at conveying them?

364
00:31:29,884 --> 00:31:34,504
私つづいてゆくわ
I will keep going on,

365
00:31:35,084 --> 00:31:39,484
いつまでも 忘れない
never forgetting, forever.

366
00:31:40,004 --> 00:31:45,444
出会えた奇跡 偶然じゃない そうでしょ？
The miracle of meeting wasn't a coincidence, right?

367
00:31:45,924 --> 00:31:50,544
大嫌いから 大好きへと
From "I hate you" to "I love you",

368
00:31:50,824 --> 00:31:55,904
変わる心についていきたいよ
I want to keep up with this changing heart.

369
00:31:56,284 --> 00:32:01,124
どんなことも あなたさえ
No matter what, even you—

370
00:32:01,744 --> 00:32:04,624
言葉を分析
analyzing the words.

371
00:32:04,884 --> 00:32:07,004
でも私、私、私、私、私は
But I, I, I, I, I—

372
00:32:07,504 --> 00:32:11,244
ずっとずっとずっとずっと あなたに愛を今
Forever and ever, my love to you right now—

373
00:32:12,804 --> 00:32:15,164
繋がってたい
I want to stay connected.

374
00:32:15,584 --> 00:32:18,484
We are the bright

375
00:32:18,944 --> 00:32:24,464
We are the bright, We are the bright, please!

376
00:32:41,575 --> 00:32:46,095
すごい！この曲あれか、五等分の花嫁の曲だ！
Amazing! Is this song from The Quintessential Quintuplets?!

377
00:32:46,375 --> 00:32:47,215
そうなんだよ！
That's right!

378
00:32:47,835 --> 00:32:50,415
ここにね、5人集められたかみんなわかる？
Does everyone know why the five of us were gathered here?

379
00:32:50,755 --> 00:32:53,355
えー、わかんない！
Eh, I don't know!

380
00:32:53,575 --> 00:32:54,455
わかんない！
I have no idea!

381
00:32:54,695 --> 00:32:55,755
頭を見るんだ！頭！
Look at the head! The head!

382
00:32:57,235 --> 00:32:59,395
ヘッド！ヘッド！
Head! Head!

383
00:32:59,395 --> 00:33:02,375
ゴールデンヘッド！
Golden head!

384
00:33:06,895 --> 00:33:10,055
そこも5人で寝るの！だから歌いたかったんだ！
We sleep 5 of us there too! That's why we wanted to sing it!

385
00:33:14,395 --> 00:33:19,515
てことはさ、でもこの曲だと、私たちの中から1人選んでもらわなきゃいけないんじゃないの？
That means, but with this song, won't you have to choose one of us?

386
00:33:20,155 --> 00:33:21,135
あっそうだ！
Ah, that's right!

387
00:33:21,415 --> 00:33:24,515
選ばれなきゃいけないんだ！
We have to be chosen!

388
00:33:24,835 --> 00:33:28,475
ちょっとちょっと、でもね？この曲だったらさ、5周年なんだから
Wait, wait, but you know? Since it's this song and the 5th anniversary,

389
00:33:29,035 --> 00:33:36,615
メルの特権！メルが何番ってこと、ぜーったい！
Mel's privilege! Whatever number Mel is, absolutely!

390
00:33:36,995 --> 00:33:39,195
やったー！
Yay!

391
00:33:41,248 --> 00:33:47,435
元気、やる気、夜空心！
Energy, motivation, Yozora heart!

392
00:33:56,626 --> 00:33:59,986
おまたせ！遅くなってごめんね
Sorry to keep you waiting! Sorry I'm late.

393
00:34:00,226 --> 00:34:03,546
大丈夫だよ！今日はなにしてたの？
It's fine! What were you doing today?

394
00:34:03,786 --> 00:34:11,386
今日はね！ちょこ先生とねねちと…ってことがあってさ！めっちゃ楽しかったよ！
Today! Choko-sensei, Nenechi, and... something happened! It was super fun!

395
00:34:12,348 --> 00:34:16,048
(楽しそうに話すメルを見て微笑ましい反面、少しもやもやした感情になってしまった。)
Seeing Mel talk so happily brought a smile to my face, but at the same time, I felt a lingering sense of unease.

396
00:34:17,048 --> 00:34:20,548
(せっかく時間を作ってくれてるのにこんなんじゃダメだな)
She went out of her way to make time for me, I shouldn't be feeling like this.

397
00:34:21,048 --> 00:34:23,948
んー？なんかあった？
Hm? Did something happen?

398
00:34:24,248 --> 00:34:28,048
(うまく隠したつもりだったけどどうやら気づかれたようだ。)
I thought I hid it well, but apparently she noticed.

399
00:34:29,848 --> 00:34:32,048
(なんでわかるんだろ…)
How does she know...

400
00:34:33,048 --> 00:34:34,948
えっな、なんで？
Eh, wh- why?

401
00:34:35,448 --> 00:34:40,048
そりゃあ君のことちゃんと言ってますから！わかるよ？
Well, because I'm always watching out for you! I can tell, you know?

402
00:34:41,148 --> 00:34:45,548
…いや、その。僕がいるときもちゃんと楽しめてるのかなって…
...Well, um. I was wondering if you're actually enjoying yourself when you're with me...

403
00:34:46,048 --> 00:34:55,548
もう！楽しみに決まってるでしょ！じゃなかったらこんなおしゃれして一週間前からずっと楽しみになんかしてないってば！
Geez! Of course it's fun! Otherwise, why would I dress up like this and look forward to it all week?!

404
00:34:56,248 --> 00:34:59,848
(頬を膨らませて怒るメルを見て不謹慎だけど僕は安心した。)
Seeing Mel puff out her cheeks in anger, though a bit inappropriate, made me feel relieved.

405
00:35:00,256 --> 00:35:01,056
(頬を膨らませて怒るメルを見て不機嫌だけど僕は安心した。)
(Seeing Mel puff out her cheeks in anger, I felt uneasy, yet relieved.)

406
00:35:01,156 --> 00:35:04,475
ていうか君もそういうこと考えるんだね
I mean, you think about things like that too, huh?

407
00:35:05,156 --> 00:35:06,856
え？
Eh?

408
00:35:07,156 --> 00:35:13,256
ううん、いつもそういうの隠すからさ！ふふ、可愛いところあるね～
N-no, it's just you always hide that kind of stuff! Hehe, that's kind of cute~

409
00:35:13,956 --> 00:35:17,856
あのさ、この間ドレス着てみたいって言ってたよね。本当に着てない？
Say, the other day you said you wanted to try wearing a dress. Have you really not worn one?

410
00:35:18,956 --> 00:35:22,556
えっ？！着れるの…？！！！
Eh?! You mean I can wear one...?!

411
00:35:58,713 --> 00:36:02,223
朝になったら
When the morning comes,

412
00:36:03,273 --> 00:36:09,373
二人目を合わせて
our eyes gently meet,

413
00:36:11,023 --> 00:36:15,423
たわいないこと少し話したいな
and I get the urge to talk about frivolous things.

414
00:36:16,223 --> 00:36:21,923
少し話したいな
I want to talk a little bit.

415
00:36:23,923 --> 00:36:28,123
晴れた午後は
On a clear afternoon,

416
00:36:29,123 --> 00:36:35,423
そっと手をつないで
we join hands softly,

417
00:36:36,723 --> 00:36:47,523
穏やかな街を少し歩いてみたり
and take a short walk through the quiet city.

418
00:36:49,323 --> 00:37:01,423
そんな想像さえ愛おしくて
just being able to imagine those things is so dear to me...

419
00:37:02,223 --> 00:37:15,723
いつまでも同じ時間を一緒に過ごしていたくて
I want to spend the same time together with you forever,

420
00:37:19,423 --> 00:37:32,523
だって朝も夜も伝えたいことたくさんあって
because endlessly, on and on, I have so many things I want to tell you!

421
00:37:33,723 --> 00:37:48,923
今日も明日も好きだなんて言えたら
if I could just tell you "I love you" today and tomorrow too...

422
00:38:12,723 --> 00:38:24,523
夜になったら星の見える場所で
When the night comes to a place where we can see the stars,

423
00:38:25,423 --> 00:38:36,223
眠りにつくまでずっと寄り添っていたいな
until we fall asleep, I want to stay close by your side.

424
00:38:38,323 --> 00:38:48,623
触られる距離が愛おしくて
Just being close enough to touch is so dear to me,

425
00:38:51,323 --> 00:39:04,623
その声をその体温をもっと感じてたくて
I want to feel your voice and your warmth even more,

426
00:39:07,923 --> 00:39:21,423
だって何度も何度も名前を呼んでもまだ足りなくて
because no matter how many times I call your name, it's still not enough!

427
00:39:22,523 --> 00:39:36,223
今日も明日もそう二人でいれたら
if we could just be together like that today and tomorrow too...

428
00:39:39,223 --> 00:39:50,123
切ないときは綺麗な花を飾りましょう
Whenever we're hurt, let's decorate with beautiful flowers!

429
00:39:51,723 --> 00:39:59,056
悲しいときは楽しい話をしましょう
Whenever we're sad, let's talk about something fun!

430
00:40:00,064 --> 00:40:02,064
切ないときは 綺麗な花を飾りましょう
When it's painful, let's decorate with flowers,

431
00:40:02,064 --> 00:40:04,064
悲しいときは 楽しい話をしましょう
when it's sad, let's talk about fun things.

432
00:40:07,614 --> 00:40:11,264
髪に 頬に
Upon your hair, upon your cheeks,

433
00:40:11,264 --> 00:40:17,564
ただ触れてくれるだけでuh
just by having you touch me...

434
00:40:17,864 --> 00:40:30,864
暗い心も 瞬間 明るくなるんだって
even a gloomy heart brightens in an instant!

435
00:40:33,264 --> 00:40:44,864
朝も 夜も 叶えたいことこんなにあって
Every morning and night, I have so many dreams to fulfill,

436
00:40:45,564 --> 00:40:59,864
今日も 明日も 幸せだと言えたらいいのに
if only I could say I'm happy today and tomorrow too.

437
00:41:08,564 --> 00:41:14,264
メルは あなたのことを 愛しています
Mel loves you so, so much!

438
00:41:32,264 --> 00:41:35,564
みんな ここまで歌ってきたけどどうですか？
Everyone, I've sung up to here, how is it?

439
00:41:35,564 --> 00:41:41,864
楽しんでますか？
Are you enjoying yourselves?

440
00:41:42,264 --> 00:41:49,864
ここで恒例のね、みんなお待ちかね告知タイムに行きたいと思います！
Now, it's time for our customary announcement time!

441
00:41:50,564 --> 00:41:55,864
もう5周年になるので、みんなも大体流れ分かってきたよね？
It's already my 5th anniversary, so you get the flow by now, right?

442
00:41:58,564 --> 00:42:06,564
なんと！このあと夜空メル5周年グッズが販売されます！やったー！
And guess what? Yozora Mel's 5th anniversary merch goes on sale! Yay!

443
00:42:11,264 --> 00:42:22,064
まず1つ目は、さとうぽて先生描き下ろし アクリルジオラママスタンド！
First up is the acrylic diorama stand illustrated by Satou Pote-sensei!

444
00:42:22,064 --> 00:42:32,064
なんとなんとこのアクリルスタンド、ゆらゆら揺れるようになっております！
This stand actually rocks back and forth! Isn't that amazing?

445
00:42:32,264 --> 00:42:40,564
それからね、パジャマのドレスもめちゃくちゃ可愛いのでぜひゲットしてください。
And also, the pajama dress is super cute, so please be sure to get it!

446
00:42:41,064 --> 00:42:55,564
そして2つ目は、ミシュネ先生描き下ろしの メルと始める新生活クッション！
The second item is the "New Life Cushion with Mel" by Mishune-sensei!

447
00:42:55,564 --> 00:43:02,064
君の生活の一部にメルを置いてくれると嬉しいです。
I'd be so happy if you keep Mel as part of your daily life.

448
00:43:03,064 --> 00:43:21,864
そして3つ目は、メルと契約ネックレスです！アクセサリーものは実は初めてなのでぜひつけてほしいな！
And third is the "Mel Contract Necklace"! It's my first accessory, so please wear it!

449
00:43:22,264 --> 00:43:42,564
今回のメインイラストとお揃いで、ずっと一緒にいるという契約も結べます！
It matches the main illustration, sealing a contract to be together forever!

450
00:43:45,064 --> 00:44:06,564
フルセット購入特典として、直筆サインとメッセージ入りポストカードがもらえます！
Full set purchasers get a postcard with a handwritten autograph and message!

451
00:44:07,564 --> 00:44:18,064
グッズはこのあと21時から販売されますので、よろしくお願いします！
The merch goes on sale at 21:00 tonight, so please look forward to it!

452
00:44:19,564 --> 00:44:33,064
それでは次の曲で最後なんですが、今回もメンバー限定のアフターライブを開催しちゃいます！
Now for the final song, but we're also holding a member-only after-party live!

453
00:44:34,064 --> 00:44:47,564
よかったらメンバー登録もよろしくお願いします！あッという間でしたが…
If you'd like, please sign up for membership too! It went by in a flash, but...

454
00:44:47,564 --> 00:44:59,064
5周年ももっといろんな人に楽しんでもらえるよう頑張ります！
I'll do my best so even more people can enjoy the 5th anniversary!

455
00:45:00,307 --> 00:45:01,072
みんなだけど、
Everyone,

456
00:45:01,072 --> 00:45:03,527
これからもよろしくお願いします！
from now on too, thank you for your support!

457
00:45:04,367 --> 00:45:08,067
みんなのことが好きな気持ちを最後まで込めて、
Putting all our feelings into it,

458
00:45:08,387 --> 00:45:10,667
次の曲歌います！
we'll sing the next song!

459
00:45:11,127 --> 00:45:13,747
あいも変わらずよろしくお願いしますー！
Thank you as always as well!

460
00:45:14,447 --> 00:45:17,467
はい！え、うん、じっ！
1, 2, 3!

461
00:45:25,096 --> 00:45:26,616
ねぇ、どうかな？
Hey... how is it?

462
00:45:27,546 --> 00:45:29,056
似合ってる？
Does it suit me?

463
00:45:31,326 --> 00:45:33,446
うん、綺麗だよ
Yeah, you look beautiful.

464
00:45:34,526 --> 00:45:36,776
ふふーん、ありがと！でもまさかこんな早く着れるとはな～！
Hehe, thanks! But I never thought I'd get to wear this so soon~!

465
00:45:41,206 --> 00:45:43,836
写真だけだけどね…
Well, just for photos though...

466
00:45:45,406 --> 00:45:49,106
いやーまさかメルプロポーズされたのかと思っちゃったよ！
Man, I almost thought Mel was actually proposing to me!

467
00:45:56,306 --> 00:45:58,036
いつか…ね
Someday... you know.

468
00:45:59,406 --> 00:46:01,146
ん？なんか言った？
Hm? Did you say something?

469
00:46:02,156 --> 00:46:04,026
いや！なんでもない
Nope! It's nothing.

470
00:46:04,986 --> 00:46:08,646
（やっぱりメルは深夜アニメの主人公なのかなかもしれない。）
(Maybe Mel really is the protagonist of a late-night anime.)

471
00:46:09,986 --> 00:46:13,986
あ、そうだ。お礼に…これ受け取ってほしいな
Ah, right. I want you to have this as a thank-you.

472
00:46:15,606 --> 00:46:16,966
え？これは…？
Eh? This is...?

473
00:46:18,646 --> 00:46:22,526
これはね、代々伝わる大切な人に渡すネックレスだよ。
This is a necklace passed down through generations to someone special.

474
00:46:23,306 --> 00:46:28,856
メルとずっと一緒にいる絆を結んだ者だけがつけることができるのだよ！
Only those who have tied their fate with Mel forever can wear it!

475
00:46:31,056 --> 00:46:34,576
なにこれこわ！！！っていうか中2病感いなんだけど！？
What is that, creepy?! And kind of chuunibyou?!

476
00:46:36,306 --> 00:46:40,926
うるさい！！！！っていうか！！いるのいらないの！？どっち！
Shut up! I mean! Do you want it or not? Which is it!

477
00:46:42,666 --> 00:46:45,316
…うん、ありがとう。ありがたく受け取らせていただきます
...Yeah, thank you. I gratefully accept it.

478
00:46:47,456 --> 00:46:50,026
よろしい。メルとおそろいだよ！
Good. It's matching with Mel!

479
00:46:51,416 --> 00:46:58,336
これからもこんな私だけどよろしくね。大好きだよ
From now on too, even though I'm like this, please take care of me. I love you!

480
00:47:00,746 --> 00:47:05,176
メルは少し照れながらこまったような回調で微笑んだ。
Mel smiled slightly with a bashful, awkward expression.

481
00:47:37,405 --> 00:47:39,195
誰と会ってた？って浮気した？って
"Who were you meeting?" "Were you cheating?"

482
00:47:41,295 --> 00:47:44,275
子供じゃないんだし
I'm not a child anymore,

483
00:47:46,405 --> 00:47:47,925
秘密くらいあるよ
you know I have at least a few secrets!

484
00:47:47,925 --> 00:47:52,485
全部なんて見せてちゃ続かない
I won't show you all of it!

485
00:47:58,145 --> 00:47:58,625
ケンカしてても隣で寝ること
Even if we fight, we sleep side by side.

486
00:48:07,525 --> 00:48:08,645
これからの約束ね
That's our promise from now on.

487
00:48:08,645 --> 00:48:11,925
返事！(はい)
Response! (Yes!)

488
00:48:12,465 --> 00:48:13,635
いくつになっても恋させてよアナタに
No matter how old we get, make me fall in love with you, okay?

489
00:48:16,105 --> 00:48:18,495
カッコ悪いとこは見せないようにしてあげるね
Try to make sure I don't see your uncool sides.

490
00:48:20,515 --> 00:48:24,025
愛もいいけど恋していて私に
Love is fine, but stay in love with me,

491
00:48:25,825 --> 00:48:29,425
“綺麗だね”言われるように頑張るからね
so I'll work hard so you call me "beautiful"!

492
00:48:30,895 --> 00:48:44,895
嫌な事があった日
On days when bad things happened,

493
00:48:45,435 --> 00:48:48,405
下手な料理で笑顔をありがとう
thank you for smiling at my clumsy cooking.

494
00:48:49,105 --> 00:48:55,335
合わない趣味ばかり
With hobbies that don't match at all,

495
00:48:55,775 --> 00:48:59,365
もっと教えてこの前の続き
teach me more next time, continuing from before.

496
00:48:59,805 --> 00:49:05,845
家族増えても恋人がいいな
Even if our family grows, lovers are nice,

497
00:49:07,015 --> 00:49:11,235
お揃いも増やしてよ
so let's increase our matching items too!

498
00:49:12,295 --> 00:49:19,055
返事！(はい)
Response! (Yes!)

499
00:49:19,135 --> 00:49:20,325
いくつになってもデートしてよ記念日
No matter how old we get, let's go on dates.

500
00:49:22,635 --> 00:49:25,505
プレゼントはいらないほらオシャレしてね
Presents aren't needed, just dress up nicely.

501
00:49:26,615 --> 00:49:30,635
晴れもいいけど雨の日にはくっついて
Sunny days are fine, but on rainy days, let's stay close,

502
00:49:32,025 --> 00:49:36,265
一つの傘揺らしながら虹を待つの
waiting for the rainbow while swaying a single umbrella.

503
00:49:37,455 --> 00:49:42,665
気づいてた？寝てる隙に
Did you notice? While I was asleep,

504
00:49:44,825 --> 00:49:47,455
ほっぺにそっとキスしてること
you gently kissed my cheek.

505
00:49:48,675 --> 00:49:52,995
気づかなかった？寝てる隙に
Did you realize? While I was asleep,

506
00:49:54,745 --> 00:49:57,055
つけてくれてたお揃いのリング
you put a matching ring on me.

507
00:50:00,080 --> 00:50:02,080
お揃いのリング
matching ring...

508
00:50:22,130 --> 00:50:26,230
しわが増えても
Even if wrinkles increase,

509
00:50:26,630 --> 00:50:31,330
甘えたいんだよ
I want to be spoiled.

510
00:50:32,180 --> 00:50:35,630
もちろん手も繋ぐこと
Of course, holding hands too—

511
00:50:36,130 --> 00:50:36,830
返事！
Reply!

512
00:50:37,030 --> 00:50:37,730
はい！
Yes!

513
00:50:38,030 --> 00:50:41,930
いくつになっても飽きないでね お願い
No matter how old we get, don't get tired of me, please.

514
00:50:42,430 --> 00:50:46,930
嫉妬しちゃうけど 頭撫でて なぐさめてね
I might get jealous, so pet my head and comfort me.

515
00:50:47,930 --> 00:50:52,330
いつまでもずっと 恋していて ワタシに
Always, forever stay in love with me,

516
00:50:52,730 --> 00:50:57,730
“綺麗だね” 言われるように 頑張るからね
So I'll do my best to be told "You're beautiful."

517
00:50:57,930 --> 00:50:58,530
ねっ
Right?

518
00:55:02,088 --> 00:55:06,588
みんなのおかげで5周年を迎えたよ！
Thanks to everyone, I've reached my 5th anniversary!

519
00:55:07,088 --> 00:55:12,088
これからもたくさんの楽しい思い出つくっていこうね♪
Let's make many more fun memories together♪

520
00:55:12,588 --> 00:55:17,588
BIG LOVE ♡ だいすき！！
BIG LOVE ♡ I love you so much!!

